Obtained: computed once by a script outside fog (research/ or scripts/).
Made by: research/build_bordighera.py (run once, 2026-10-06/14)
From: IGN LiDAR HD (the eye's ground), OpenStreetMap building footprints (ODbL), Copernicus DSM and
  TINITALY 1.1 (INGV, CC BY 4.0) for heights; the eye's position is private
  (data/hh/bordighera/raw/eye.json, never in git).
Licence: ODbL-1.0 for the buildings (derived from OpenStreetMap); CC-BY-4.0 for the rest
What could still be wrong: Positions are given relative to the eye, to the metre; the eye itself is
  not published.
