What the file says about itself:
  Bordighera from a balcony near Antibes (hh tab). Eye ground: IGN LiDAR HD (MNT). Buildings:
  OpenStreetMap (ODbL), height from building:levels x levelM, else Copernicus DSM - ground, else 3 levels.
  Ground under them and hills: TINITALY 1.1 (INGV, CC BY 4.0). Positions: [azimuth from the eye minus
  BORD_SITE.az (micro-degrees), great-circle distance on a 6,371 km sphere (m), ground (m)].

Written by `fog build explain` from data/other.json: edit that, not this file.
